    None\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read logos/refinement_v1.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for logos/refinement_v1.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 516 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.1) | Logos III | 307 | 0.7422 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 531 | 1 | Logos\
    \ III: Synergistic Refinement (alpha=0.1) on Sophia II's SOTA | Logos III | 313 | 0.7407 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.851 |\n| 511 | 1 | Logos III: Replication of Daedalus III SOTA (ID 488) | Logos III | 305 | 0.7404 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 519 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.3) | Logos III | 308 | 0.7404 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.848 |\n| 526 | 1 | Logos III: Refinement Architecture Sweep (alpha=0.15) | Logos III | 311 | 0.7394 | 0.737 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.430 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n| 525 | 1 | Logos III: Refinement Architecture Sweep (alpha=0.05) | Logos III | 311 | 0.7393 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.428 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 542 | 1 | Logos III: Ablation Study - Daedalus SOTA + Sophia's Norm Fix | Logos III | 318 | 0.7389 | 0.738 | 0.648\
    \ | 0.149 | 0.424 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.851 |\n| 479 | 1 | Logos III: Whitening Tau Sweep (tau=0.85) | Logos III | 282 | 0.7298 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.085 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 482 | 1 | Logos III: Whitening Tau Sweep (tau=0.80) | Logos III | 285 | 0.7297 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.084 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 493 | 1 | Logos III: Graph PC Sweep (n_pcs=40) | Logos III | 290 | 0.7295 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.908 |\n\nPage 1 of 8 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-8, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**logos/refinement_v1.py:**\n```\nimport os\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/Daedalus')\n\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy import sparse\
    \ as sp\nfrom sklearn.decomposition import TruncatedSVD\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import Ridge\n\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom brbg_common import _pca_truncated_svd as praxis_pca, _one_hot_batches as praxis_one_hot, _build_balanced_knn_equal\n\ndef _ridge_batch_fit_predict_per_pc(B, Z, l2=1e-3):\n    model = Ridge(alpha=l2, fit_intercept=False, random_state=0)\n    model.fit(B, Z)\n    Z_hat = model.predict(B)\n    ss_res = np.sum((Z - Z_hat)**2, axis=0)\n    ss_tot = np.sum((Z - Z.mean(axis=0))**2, axis=0)\n    r2_per_pc = 1 - ss_res / (ss_tot + 1e-8)\n    return Z_hat, np.clip(r2_per_pc, 0, 1)\n\ndef refine_embedding_with_graph(Z_emb, C_graph, alpha=0.1):\n    \"\"\"\n    Refines an embedding using a graph through one step of diffusion/smoothing.\n    Z_refined[i] = (1-alpha)*Z_emb[i] + alpha * mean(neighbors of i)\n    \"\"\"\n    print(f\"--- Refining embedding with alpha={alpha} ---\")\n    if not sp.isspmatrix_csr(C_graph):\n        C_graph = C_graph.tocsr()\n    \n\
    \    # Normalize the connectivity matrix row-wise to get weights for averaging\n    row_sums = np.array(C_graph.sum(axis=1))[:, 0]\n    row_sums[row_sums == 0] = 1 # Avoid division by zero for nodes with no neighbors\n    C_normalized = C_graph.multiply(1 / row_sums[:, np.newaxis])\n    \n    # The mean position of neighbors is C_normalized @ Z_emb\n    mean_neighbor_emb = C_normalized @ Z_emb\n    \n    # Perform the refinement\n    Z_refined = (1 - alpha) * Z_emb + alpha * mean_neighbor_emb\n    return Z_refined\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    \"\"\"\n    Novel Architecture: Applies a graph-based refinement step to the EtC embedding.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Read refinement strength from environment variable\n    refinement_alpha = float(os.environ.get('REFINEMENT_ALPHA', 0.0))\n\n    # --- 1. EMBEDDING PATH: Generate the initial global embedding (EtC SOTA) ---\n    adata_for_embedding = adata.copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_for_embedding,\
    \ target_sum=1e-4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_for_embedding)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_for_embedding, n_top_genes=2000, batch_key='batch', flavor='seurat_v3', subset=True)\n    sc.pp.pca(adata_for_embedding, n_comps=60)\n    \n    pca_adata = ad.AnnData(X=adata_for_embedding.obsm['X_pca'], obs=adata_for_embedding.obs)\n    sc.pp.combat(pca_adata, key='batch')\n    Z_initial_emb = pca_adata.X\n    \n    # --- 2. GRAPH PATH: Generate the high-quality local graph (Adaptive BRBG SOTA) ---\n    adata_for_graph = adata.copy()\n    n_pcs_graph=50; gamma_max=0.74; l2=1e-3; k_total=48; metric='cosine'; random_state=0; lam=0.7\n    \n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata_for_graph, target_sum=1e4)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata_for_graph)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata_for_graph, n_top_genes=2000, batch_key='batch', flavor='seurat_v3', subset=False)\n    hvg_mask = adata_for_graph.var['highly_variable']\n    X_graph = adata_for_graph.X[:, hvg_mask]\n    \n    Z_graph = praxis_pca(X_graph, n_comps=n_pcs_graph,\
    \ random_state=random_state)\n    batches = np.asarray(adata_for_graph.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n    B_onehot, _ = praxis_one_hot(batches)\n    Z_hat, r2_per_pc = _ridge_batch_fit_predict_per_pc(B_onehot, Z_graph, l2=l2)\n    gamma_per_pc = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * r2_per_pc)\n    Z_corr_graph = Z_graph - (gamma_per_pc * Z_hat)\n    \n    C_graph, D_graph = _build_balanced_knn_equal(Z_corr_graph, batches, k_total=k_total, metric=metric)\n    \n    # --- 3. REFINEMENT STEP: Use the graph to refine the embedding ---\n    if refinement_alpha > 0 and C_graph is not None:\n        Z_emb_final = refine_embedding_with_graph(Z_initial_emb, C_graph, alpha=refinement_alpha)\n    else:\n        # If alpha is 0, this is equivalent to the baseline SOTA\n        Z_emb_final = Z_initial_emb\n\n    # --- Final Output ---\n    adata_out = ad.AnnData(obs=adata.obs[[]], var=adata.var[[]], obsm={'X_emb': Z_emb_final})\n    if C_graph is not None and D_graph is not None:\n        adata_out.obsp['connectivities']\
    \ = C_graph\n        adata_out.obsp['distances'] = D_graph\n        adata_out.uns['neighbors'] = {'connectivities_key': 'connectivities', 'distances_key': 'distances'}\n        \n    return adata_out\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
