    ### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Logos IV: Hypothesis Test - Standard kNN vs. Balanced kNN' (ID: 602) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6259373241168361\n**ASW_batch:** 0.632\n**ASW_label:** 0.161\n**ARI:** 0.472\n**NMI:** 0.675\n**Graph_conn:** 0.958\n**kBET:** 0.836\n**iLISI:** 0.033\n**cLISI:** 0.978\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.516\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.632  ASW_label: 0.161  ARI: 0.472  NMI: 0.675\n  Graph_conn: 0.958  kBET: 0.836  iLISI: 0.033  cLISI: 0.978\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.516\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.818190  ASW_label: 0.504383  ARI: 0.471937  NMI: 0.675242\n  Graph_conn: 0.958370  kBET: 0.796600  iLISI: 0.032719  cLISI: 0.993488\n  PCR: 0.999841  Cell_cycle: 0.448838\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n \
    \ Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/8e1c5cd2-4e18-4e41-a1b2-f01a1d79b0bd/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 8e1c5cd2-4e18-4e41-a1b2-f01a1d79b0bd\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI\
    \ | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 516 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.1) | Logos III | 307 | 0.7422 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.458 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 531 | 1 | Logos III: Synergistic Refinement (alpha=0.1) on Sophia II's SOTA | Logos III | 313 | 0.7407 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.851 |\n| 511 | 1 | Logos III: Replication of Daedalus III SOTA (ID 488) | Logos III | 305 | 0.7404 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 519 | 1 | Logos III: Novel 'Refinement Architecture' Test (alpha=0.3) | Logos III | 308 | 0.7404 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.440 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.848 |\n| 526 | 1 | Logos III: Refinement Architecture Sweep (alpha=0.15) | Logos III | 311 | 0.7394 | 0.737 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.430 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.850 |\n| 525 |\
    \ 1 | Logos III: Refinement Architecture Sweep (alpha=0.05) | Logos III | 311 | 0.7393 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.428 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.849 |\n| 542 | 1 | Logos III: Ablation Study - Daedalus SOTA + Sophia's Norm Fix | Logos III | 318 | 0.7389 | 0.738 | 0.648 | 0.149 | 0.424 | 0.972 | 0.701 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.851 |\n| 479 | 1 | Logos III: Whitening Tau Sweep (tau=0.85) | Logos III | 282 | 0.7298 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.085 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.906 |\n| 482 | 1 | Logos III: Whitening Tau Sweep (tau=0.80) | Logos III | 285 | 0.7297 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.084 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.905 |\n| 493 | 1 | Logos III: Graph PC Sweep (n_pcs=40) | Logos III | 290 | 0.7295 | 0.736 | 0.839 | 0.157 | 0.079 | 0.972 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.935 | 0.908 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
