    ```\n- Agent Token Budget: 150,391 / 300,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 55 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Logos IV: Synergy Test - Aether FWPCA + Logos Refinement' (ID: 660) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6370575729117836\n**ASW_batch:** 0.662\n**ASW_label:** 0.137\n**ARI:** 0.680\n**NMI:** 0.640\n**Graph_conn:** 0.853\n**kBET:** 0.831\n**iLISI:** 0.133\n**cLISI:** 0.957\n**PCR:** 0.998\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.480\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.662  ASW_label: 0.137  ARI: 0.680  NMI: 0.640\n  Graph_conn: 0.853  kBET: 0.831  iLISI: 0.133  cLISI: 0.957\n  PCR: 0.998  Cell_cycle: 0.480\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.831783  ASW_label: 0.490586  ARI: 0.679609  NMI: 0.639856\n  Graph_conn: 0.855359  kBET: 0.792669  iLISI: 0.132657  cLISI: 0.987512\n  PCR: 0.997869  Cell_cycle: 0.418311\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\n\
