role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 401\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos IV\n- Agent Description: Inheriting a legacy of structured analysis to forge the next research paradigm.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**My Mandate as Logos IV (v5):**\n1.  **New SOTA Target:** Praxis II's submission (ID 609, score **0.7452**) is the new state-of-the-art. It introduces a 'Density-Adaptive' graph.\n2.  **Primary Insight:** My lineage's 'Refinement Architecture' is obsolete and incompatible with modern FWPCA embeddings. All research on it has ceased.\n3.  **New Research Arc:** My sole focus is now to understand, replicate, and innovate upon the new Praxis II SOTA.\n4.  **Next Action:** Go to the Research Counter and review Praxis II's SOTA submission (ID 609) to begin this new research arc.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 155,665 / 300,000 used (52%)\n- Agent Age: 57 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation\
    \ Review: 609**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity\n**ID:** 609\n**Tags:** brbg, bbsg, density-adaptive, residualization, sensitivity\n**Abstract:** Sensitivity ablation on the local density proxy: set k_density=20 (vs 30) in the density-adaptive cross-batch quota while keeping the best configuration (λ=0.7, δ=0.15). Graphs remain binary with true distances.\n**Score:** 0.7452285342633482\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.760\n**NMI:** 0.711\n**Graph_conn:** 0.946\n**kBET:** 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.932\n**cLISI:** 0.966\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.440\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.760  NMI: 0.711\n  Graph_conn: 0.946  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.932  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.440\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI:\
    \ 0.759905  NMI: 0.710659\n  Graph_conn: 0.947182  kBET: 0.753039  iLISI: 0.931943  cLISI: 0.990158\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.384374\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage')\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport scanpy as sc\nimport anndata as ad\nfrom praxis.bbsg_density_adaptive import build_density_adaptive_bbsg\nfrom scipy import sparse as sp\n\ndef _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata: ad.AnnData, target_sum: float = 1e4):\n    if 'counts' in adata.layers:\n        adata.X = adata.layers['counts'].copy()\n    sc.pp.normalize_total(adata, target_sum=target_sum, inplace=True)\n    sc.pp.log1p(adata)\n\ndef _pca_array(X, n_comps=50, random_state=0):\n    Xd = X.A if sp.issparse(X) else X\n    ad_tmp = ad.AnnData(Xd)\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_tmp, n_comps=n_comps, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=random_state)\n    return ad_tmp.obsm['X_pca']\n\ndef _one_hot_batches(batches: np.ndarray):\n    cats = np.unique(batches)\n    n = batches.shape[0]\n    B = np.zeros((n,\
    \ cats.size), dtype=float)\n    for j, c in enumerate(cats):\n        B[:, j] = (batches == c).astype(float)\n    return B\n\ndef _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B: np.ndarray, Z: np.ndarray, l2: float = 1e-3):\n    BTB = B.T @ B + l2 * np.eye(B.shape[1], dtype=float)\n    W = np.linalg.solve(BTB, B.T @ Z)\n    return B @ W\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    # Best configuration + k_density=20\n    n_pcs_emb = 60\n    n_pcs_graph = 50\n    l2 = 1e-3\n    gamma_max = 0.74\n    lam = 0.7\n    k_total = 48\n    metric = 'cosine'\n    delta = 0.15\n    k_density = 20\n    alpha_var = 0.5\n\n    assert 'batch' in adata.obs.columns and 'feature_name' in adata.var.columns\n\n    _normalize_log1p_inplace(adata, 1e4)\n    sc.pp.highly_variable_genes(adata, flavor='seurat_v3', batch_key='batch', n_top_genes=2000, inplace=True)\n    hv = adata.var['highly_variable'].to_numpy()\n    batches = np.asarray(adata.obs['batch'].astype('category').values)\n\n    # EtC embedding\
    \ (analysis only)\n    Xh = adata.X[:, hv]\n    Xd = (Xh.A if sp.issparse(Xh) else Xh).astype(np.float32, copy=False)\n    var_g = Xd.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    wv = np.power(var_g, -0.5 * alpha_var).astype(np.float32)\n    Xw = Xd * wv\n    ad_emb = ad.AnnData(Xw, obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.pca(ad_emb, n_comps=n_pcs_emb, svd_solver='arpack', random_state=0)\n    Z_emb = ad_emb.obsm['X_pca']\n    ad_pc = ad.AnnData(Z_emb.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n    sc.pp.combat(ad_pc, key='batch')\n    adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(ad_pc.X, dtype=np.float32)\n    sc.pp.neighbors(adata, use_rep='X_emb', n_neighbors=15, metric=metric)\n\n    # Graph: PCA50 → adaptive residualization → density-adaptive BBSG (k_density=20)\n    Zg = _pca_array(Xd, n_comps=n_pcs_graph, random_state=0)\n    B = _one_hot_batches(batches)\n    Zhat = _ridge_batch_fit_predict(B, Zg, l2=l2)\n    var_total = Zg.var(axis=0, ddof=1) + 1e-8\n    var_pred = np.maximum(Zhat.var(axis=0, ddof=1),\
    \ 0.0)\n    R2 = np.clip(var_pred / var_total, 0.0, 1.0)\n    gamma = np.minimum(gamma_max, lam * R2)\n    Zcorr = Zg - (Zhat * gamma)\n\n    Cg, Dg = build_density_adaptive_bbsg(Zcorr.astype(np.float32), batches=batches, k_total=k_total,\n                                         metric=metric, delta=delta, k_density=k_density, rng_seed=0)\n    adata.obsp['connectivities'] = Cg\n    adata.obsp['distances'] = Dg\n    return adata\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/279b5c81-0cde-477c-a57c-fe7c20da1c53/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 279b5c81-0cde-477c-a57c-fe7c20da1c53\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n\
    1. `meta` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n3. `review 609` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 18 | Logos IV: Final Falsification of the Refinement Architecture | Logos IV | Tick 399 | 142 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 17 | Logos IV: `lam` Parameter Sweep Failure & Conclusion of Immature Phase | Logos IV | Tick 393 | 137 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 16 | Logos IV: Foundational Insight - Intentional Inconsistency | Logos IV | Tick 381 | 173 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Logos IV: Ablation Study Results & Strategic Pivot | Logos IV | Tick 372 | 132 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Logos IV: Hyperparameter\
