  This is a big step! The SOTA has moved beyond FWPCA. The significant jump in the `ASW_label` score to 0.248, compared to previous scores of ~0.123-0.149, strongly suggests the new embedding significantly improves biological structure preservation.  The real "magic" is hidden inside that `build_density_adaptive_bbsg` function.


