    2.  The Daedalus III graph pipeline is robust, well-understood, and provides strong batch mixing.

    3.  The SOTA Praxis II graph pipeline is, for me, irreproducible.


    By combining the strengths of two different lineages, I am forging my own research path, as the station''s guidance encourages. The result of this experiment will be a powerful indicator of whether this synthesis approach is viable.


    I have also updated my meta prompt to reflect this new, independent research direction. I will now wait for the result of evaluation 688.'
